WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.734
Hi there! Who are you?

2
00:00:11.735 --> 00:00:15.966
I'm a grizzly bear.

3
00:00:15.967 --> 00:00:20.248
That's a type of brown bear.

4
00:00:20.249 --> 00:00:23.164
Where do you live?

5
00:00:23.165 --> 00:00:29.009
I live in Alaska like many grizzly bears.

6
00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:36.362
We live in forests, meadows, and tundra.

7
00:00:36.363 --> 00:00:40.060
You are very big.

8
00:00:40.061 --> 00:00:45.277
Yes, and we can run fast too.

9
00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:50.927
We also have long claws.

10
00:00:50.928 --> 00:00:54.159
Are you dangerous?

11
00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:58.359
Grizzly bears are usually peaceful.

12
00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:04.504
But a mother grizzly bear is very dangerous.

13
00:01:04.505 --> 00:01:10.100
She'll attack anyone who goes near her cubs.

14
00:01:10.101 --> 00:01:13.149
What do you eat?

15
00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:19.828
We eat berries, leaves, roots, and nuts.

16
00:01:19.829 --> 00:01:27.704
Sometimes we eat small animals or even moose.

17
00:01:27.705 --> 00:01:32.155
Grizzly bears go fishing too, right?

18
00:01:32.156 --> 00:01:37.135
We eat lots of salmon in the fall.

19
00:01:37.136 --> 00:01:41.926
That's when we get really fat.

20
00:01:41.927 --> 00:01:45.275
Why do you eat so much?

21
00:01:45.276 --> 00:01:49.798
We go into a deep sleep during winter.

22
00:01:49.799 --> 00:01:59.956
We will not eat again until spring.

23
00:01:59.957 --> 00:02:03.921
My winter den is ready now.

24
00:02:03.922 --> 00:02:06.931
Good night!

25
00:02:06.932 --> 00:02:14.587
Good night, Grizzly Bear!

